<item>
            <title>[MAHOUT-26] Matrix implementation bug fix and little addition</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/MAHOUT-26</link>
                <project id="12310751" key="MAHOUT">Mahout</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Some bugfixes to matrix multiplication and implementation of recursive determinant calculation using Laplace theorem&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment>&lt;p&gt;JDK 1.6, IntelliJ Idea 7.0.2&lt;/p&gt;</environment>
        <key id="12393263">MAHOUT-26</key>
            <summary>Matrix implementation bug fix and little addition</summary>
