                                        <due></due>
                            <votes>0</votes>
                                    <watches>0</watches>
                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="12586128" author="corr" created="Sun, 6 Apr 2008 13:22:28 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Fixes. I&apos;ve also implemented linear equation system solution using Cramer method(on top of this matrix implementation). If anyone need it i could commit it also&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="12586153" author="karl.wettin" created="Sun, 6 Apr 2008 17:37:38 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Thanks Sergey!&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Could you please also add a unit test that catches the bug and demonstrate that the fix works?&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;   karl&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="12586496" author="corr" created="Mon, 7 Apr 2008 18:53:29 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Added tests for bug and determinant calculation. Only added tests to DenseMatrix. Should i copypaste them into other tests?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="12587447" author="karl.wettin" created="Thu, 10 Apr 2008 01:04:41 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Please stand by for &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/MAHOUT-33&quot; title=&quot;Matrix tests share code that can be placed in an abstract class&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;MAHOUT-33&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;MAHOUT-33&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="12587976" author="karl.wettin" created="Fri, 11 Apr 2008 14:02:05 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I just committed &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/MAHOUT-33&quot; title=&quot;Matrix tests share code that can be placed in an abstract class&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;MAHOUT-33&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;MAHOUT-33&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; together with the multiplication bug fix. &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I&apos;ll commence with the Laplace part now. Should we perhaps link to the Wikipedia Laplace transformation page in the javadocs?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="12587981" author="karl.wettin" created="Fri, 11 Apr 2008 14:14:35 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Laplace parts commited in reversion 647148.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Thanks Sergey!&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="12587983" author="corr" created="Fri, 11 Apr 2008 14:18:40 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I think it would be a good idea&lt;br/&gt;
We could also implement another implementations of determinant calculation but I don&apos;t think they are more efficient than this one&lt;br/&gt;
The other useful things to implement are multiplication of matrix by vector and vector transposition(returning a Matrix) and maybe calculating inverse matrix&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="12588498" author="karl.wettin" created="Mon, 14 Apr 2008 07:15:43 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I just managed to commit a fix for &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/MAHOUT-34&quot; title=&quot;Iterator interface for Vectors&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;MAHOUT-34&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;MAHOUT-34&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; but wrote this issue in the svn comment.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
